}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," The Lord’s care for the righteous and the demise of the wicked both demonstrate the Lord’s principle of retribution (see ",{"href":"?bref=Gal.6.7-10","r":"Gal.6.7-10","rawR":"Gal.6.7-10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gal.6.7-10","value":"Gal.6.7-10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gal 6:7-10"},"). The brief and futile lives of the wicked will end, whereas the Lord and his saints will triumph (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.9.5","r":"Ps.9.5","rawR":"Ps.9.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.9.5","value":"Ps.9.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 9:5"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.9.6","r":"Ps.9.6","rawR":"Ps.9.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.9.6","value":"Ps.9.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"6"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.9.18","r":"Ps.9.18","rawR":"Ps.9.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.9.18","value":"Ps.9.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.10.16","r":"Ps.10.16","rawR":"Ps.10.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.10.16","value":"Ps.10.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.37.20","r":"Ps.37.20","rawR":"Ps.37.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.37.20","value":"Ps.37.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"37:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.73.27","r":"Ps.73.27","rawR":"Ps.73.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.73.27","value":"Ps.73.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"73:27"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.92.9","r":"Ps.92.9","rawR":"Ps.92.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.92.9","value":"Ps.92.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"92:9"},"; cp. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.142.4","r":"Ps.142.4","rawR":"Ps.142.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.142.4","value":"Ps.142.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"142:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.57.1","r":"Isa.57.1","rawR":"Isa.57.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.57.1","value":"Isa.57.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isa 57:1"},"). • The godly (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.5.12","r":"Ps.5.12","rawR":"Ps.5.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.5.12","value":"Ps.5.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 5:12"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.14.5","r":"Ps.14.5","rawR":"Ps.14.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.14.5","value":"Ps.14.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"14:5"},") are joyful (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.1.1","r":"Ps.1.1","rawR":"Ps.1.1","source